===A7_S3_D1===
Narrator: You settle next to Amelia while the Ichthyos and Krakenfolk run about — stealing food, chatting over the fire, and doing crafts without even looking down at their hands. 
// #audio:fireplace
Noelle: Enjoying yourself? #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Amelia: Well, as much as I can. That Zale guy— #portrait:AmeliaShut
Zale: ! #portrait:Zale
Amelia: <i>No more!</i> This plate is MINE! #portrait:AmeliaHostile
Amelia: He’s been stealing exactly two fish from my plate whenever I cooked in the past nights! #portrait:AmeliaHostile
Narrator: And today, she finally managed to keep it out of his reach. Zale scratches the back of his neck, accepting defeat.
Zale: Alright, alright. Sorry for pulling a quick one over you. It’s just, normally we can’t try and season the fish until it’s cool, so the ones you grill always taste better. #portrait:Zale
Narrator: Amelia turns away with a ‘hmph,’ but mutters that she’ll make more tomorrow. Zale brightens, the exchange making you laugh.
Zale: You’ve also adjusted pretty quickly. How’s your hair and skin feeling? #portrait:Zale
Noelle: They’re fine! I actually feel kind of refreshed now, whenever I come back from the ocean. #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Narrator: Zale plops onto the sand, eyes crinkling as he gazes out at the waves crashing by.
Zale: Yeah, it’s pretty hard to go back to life on land, once you’re used to it. #portrait:Zale
Zale: But make sure you don’t try to swim at night. It’s dangerous for newbies, and even the Ichthyos. #portrait:Zale
Narrator: Stories from Saorise say that the ocean responds to the Moon, growing wild and mournful under its light.
Amelia: Don’t worry, I won’t let her get that far. #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Amelia: I’m here to look out for you, right, Noelle? #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Noelle: Right. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Noelle: (Tomorrow, I’m supposed to help the other Krakenfolk bring some supplies to the human settlement, to enter transit up the mountains.) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Noelle: (Best to confirm the details with Saorise now, since she has time.) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
-> DONE